ations in Ras Al Khaimah\"},{\"_key\":\"0e70c4382fed\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" – the official portal of Ras Al Khaimah Government\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"2cc22ad6eb15\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.rak.ae/wps/portal/rak/home/citizens/sociallife/charityinrasalkhaimah/!ut/p/z1/jc_NDsIgEATgR2IXocARNGD9SWO1tXIxnAxJWz0Yn9_aW0m07m2TbyYZ4klDfB9e8Rae8d6HdvgvPrsyREoVw710moPeiB0_KEsLheScAJBqAEes66XBtWTE_5OHL6dhPu-nBBalBW2cpidRUsh5ClwhzKdD8hUCsG2WgumGys6AceQIfqx4dFUDMY9vOkoVQg!!/dz/d5/L0lDUmlTUSEhL3dHa0FKRnNBLzROV3FpQSEhL2Vu/\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f06acb7a7e4b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a7389032ed86\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"8761326f259b\"],\"text\":\"UAE Water Foundation (Suqia)\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"8761326f259b\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.suqia.ae/\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f6c23c4f7278\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"75ea6dc81150\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Types of Online Donations\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"7643e51647cb\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b972f9f79d59\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Online donation platforms offer various options to support charitable causes:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8a8ea57f7c09\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c8c712ea1845\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"One-time donations:\"},{\"_key\":\"0fe3d9b3c611\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" A single contribution to a specific cause (e.g., Gaza relief, earthquake aid).\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c4480e0a97e6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"996d80a07b2d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Recurring donations:\"},{\"_key\":\"f5e1f6a60b1e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Monthly deductions for ongoing support (e.g., sponsoring an orphan).\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"3d0fed1c9769\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"98df491b2f9a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"In-kind donations:\"},{\"_key\":\"d69ef421a07b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Requesting pickup for non-monetary contributions like clothes or furniture.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"65998632f3ef\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"60b5c7943ded\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Zakat donations:\"},{\"_key\":\"79657c45c83f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Mandatory Islamic giving (2.5% of wealth), subject to strict \"},{\"_key\":\"4ca4a67d6749\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"eligibility rules (Nisab)\"},{\"_key\":\"488421df35f9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"2eadf9ce83ad\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8e876d6bc87e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Zakat Guide:\"},{\"_key\":\"6c56b9e99822\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Not sure if you need to pay Zakat? Check our detailed guide: \"},{\"_key\":\"647a6e427c23\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"ea948c344eed\"],\"text\":\"How to Pay Zakat in UAE Online\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"ea948c344eed\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://toptenuae.com/how-to-guides/how-to-pay-zakat-in-uae-online/\"}],\"style\":\"blockquote\"},{\"_key\":\"d310328f5e03\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3cc1d7e00133\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Accepted Payment Methods:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"285995ad2a81\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f74e2d0e021d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard)\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"899a9feb3ba1\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"40dab457cb72\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Digital Wallets (Apple Pay, Samsung Pay, Google Pay)\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"96793bb5f019\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ca88f033b38b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Direct Bank Transfers\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8c30dffa319e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0c22ce76a3f0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"SMS Donations (via Etisalat/Du)\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"50e2be78500f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5bfb8fc7346a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Tax Benefits and Zakat Implications (2026 Update)\"},{\"_key\":\"8fc69272b66a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"7450b45b4321\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"685d132285ea\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"With the UAE Corporate Tax regime fully established, understanding the financial implications of donating is crucial for businesses and individuals.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d612cc97afee\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fdc8c807235b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"1. Corporate Tax Deductions\"},{\"_key\":\"a9e04b63095e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Under the UAE Corporate Tax Law, donations made by businesses are \"},{\"_key\":\"30ea9a8ffac7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"tax-deductible\"},{\"_key\":\"5345afde9019\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" only if they are made to \"},{\"_key\":\"46cb202e15bb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Qualifying Public Benefit Entities (QPBEs)\"},{\"_key\":\"271292a24920\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" listed by the Ministry of Finance.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7ae2d9d90231\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3b4ba725c3c9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Benefit:\"},{\"_key\":\"ef7dce47559d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Companies can reduce their taxable income by donating to approved charities (like Emirates Red Crescent or Ma'an), provided they retain valid receipts.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e054b229f5f2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d20503c263d6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Note:\"},{\"_key\":\"790dd1797d37\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Donations to unlisted or foreign entities without approval are \"},{\"_key\":\"11923f8142ed\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"not\"},{\"_key\":\"514ef29fd064\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" deductible.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6c9d2581c99c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c92da2da9133\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"2. Zakat Obligations\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"14df716ea9d9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f16d8fe3343d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Individuals:\"},{\"_key\":\"e348df40583a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" There is no personal income tax in the UAE, so Zakat is a religious obligation rather than a tax deduction.\"},{\"_key\":\"2fbb36cf1e3c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"Calculation:\"},{\"_key\":\"df9c0df8a6ac\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" You can calculate your exact Zakat amount easily using our free \"},{\"_key\":\"cefc6d3ee0cb\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\",\"d146ddf33716\"],\"text\":\"Zakat Calculator\"},{\"_key\":\"5423b019edd9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or through \"},{\"_key\":\"5b1fbeff55cc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"2ce84d48e2ff\"],\"text\":\"official government platforms\"},{\"_key\":\"f51c8cf8c49a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"d146ddf33716\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://toptenuae.com/finance-tools/zakat-calculator/\"},{\"_key\":\"2ce84d48e2ff\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.awqaf.gov.ae/zakatPayment\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0b376a85af64\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"98ce0dd3525a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Impact of Online Donations in the UAE\"},{\"_key\":\"59b7c5f4a9da\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"38378b6ee6c8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8d3cb3948013\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Online donations have transformed philanthropy in the UAE, aligning with the nation's \\\"Smart Government\\\" vision.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"551a83f8b93c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d54e4f015b4c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Convenience and Accessibility:\"},{\"_key\":\"e4d25543f30d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Platforms provide 24/7 access. During crises, campaigns like the \"},{\"_key\":\"aada6e0e582b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"1 Billion Meals Endowment\"},{\"_key\":\"2bd0a522b06c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" successfully leveraged digital channels to raise millions in hours.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"673c653f66a5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"dde67b502b4b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Transparency and Trust:\"},{\"_key\":\"d69722393efd\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Digital receipts and blockchain integration (used by entities like Emirates Red Crescent) ensure every dirham is tracked, boosting donor confidence.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e18fc401ab6a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"57048cc71e60\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Global Reach:\"},{\"_key\":\"068e44cd7680\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Residents can easily support international relief efforts (e.g., flood relief in Asia or Africa) instantly from their phones.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"844428b2082e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0db44461e988\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Ensuring Secure & Legal Online Donations\"},{\"_key\":\"a11057ef77de\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"84ed9f1bb133\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c5b658d60a6c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"To ensure your donations are safe, legitimate, and legally compliant in the UAE, consider the following checklist:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ad717f779a39\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"620e077981fc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Verify Organization Credentials:\"},{\"_key\":\"7c7461b70fe2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Always check for government accreditation. Ensure the charity is listed on official portals like \"},{\"_key\":\"f757d51d8285\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"IACAD\"},{\"_key\":\"93391f2a0fe0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or the \"},{\"_key\":\"f85ba4e6874a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Ministry of Community Development\"},{\"_key\":\"20e6bffec2d1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"beffac8bf92e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"44ae46fd7624\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\",\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Warning:\"},{\"_key\":\"aa5afa9e9812\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\" Fundraising without a permit or donating to unauthorized entities is illegal in the UAE and can lead to legal consequences.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"blockquote\"},{\"_key\":\"ca68f075056f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"353a4a0935c1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Secure Payment Gateways:\"},{\"_key\":\"78f90cfd437e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Only donate through websites that use HTTPS security (look for the padlock icon in the browser address bar).\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"872150324f6d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fd398fcdc93e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Check for Transparency:\"},{\"_key\":\"878926d1d0fa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Legitimate charities often publish financial reports or donor impact statements.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"48d3c0077850\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c5ad2da98ce3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Avoid Personal Transfers:\"},{\"_key\":\"8276a0b70e6e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Never transfer money to personal bank accounts or unregistered numbers claiming to collect on behalf of a charity.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"83be7a97c8ba\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6282317df6cf\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Conclusion\"},{\"_key\":\"87b9d42e213e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h4\"},{\"_key\":\"f33bb196db76\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9dc991b29f7f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Online donations in the UAE have reshaped the charitable sector by enhancing efficiency, transparency, and accessibility. With the country’s strong digital infrastructure and government support, online philanthropy continues to grow. However, donors must remain vigilant against cybersecurity threats and ensure they donate only through \"},{\"_key\":\"5d22261a802b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"authorized channels\"},{\"_key\":\"75039a71b141\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to guarantee their contributions reach those in need.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"fb913252ff48\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5e63a805d76d\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"38cb252464b8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d7c1e7984445\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}]}]}],null]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full lg:w-80 shrink-0 space-y-8 mt-12 lg:mt-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-primary/5 rounded-full translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4 relative z-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-14 h-14 bg-gray-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www